  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Leaving Spain (2022), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 1,453 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Leaving Spain by Me-Linh Hannah Riemann was published by Leuven University Press in 2022. Conceptually, the work connects to Narrative, Context (archaeology), Scope (computer science), Political science and Sociology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,453 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Reduced inequalities among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven, Stiftung der Deutschen Wirtschaft and Cambridge Commonwealth European and International Trust.</p>",
